{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15114470","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114470","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511446001:":{"text":"두툰에게 대체 무슨 짓을 한 거야!","source_cn":"你对顿做了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x772E301ADCAE98BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511446002:":{"text":"흥...","source_cn":"哼……<key:dialog111>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7300E85537ED79B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511446003:":{"text":"...악마!","source_cn":"——恶魔！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x16441CAA991EA39E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...악마!","female":"...악마!","variant_male_record_index":"192805","variant_female_record_index":"192806","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511446004:":{"text":"악마?","source_cn":"恶魔？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF90090E2C2ACAD52","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"악마?","female":"악마?","variant_male_record_index":"192807","variant_female_record_index":"192808","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511447001:0":{"text":"거칠긴... 그러니까 암컷들이 너를 싫어하는 거라고.","source_cn":"真是粗暴呢……难怪没有雌性喜欢你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09B7BD6754A117D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511447002:0":{"text":"당신 뭐야?! 아메스 어디 있어?!","source_cn":"你是谁？阿米在哪？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5D04A29AC17CE28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511447003:0":{"text":"아메스...? 아~ 그 가여운 예쁜이! 이미 한 줌 흙이 되었지~ ","source_cn":"阿米……那个可怜的小美人，她已经化成一抔尘土了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6725E4B83FD66FF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511447004:1":{"text":"...아메스를 죽인 거야?!","source_cn":"——你杀了她？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F2EC68EAE6146D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511447005:0":{"text":"맞아. 조금 망설이긴 했지만, 결국 자신의 내면 깊은 곳의 욕망을 채우기 위해 나에게 모든 것을 바쳤지. 목숨까지도 말이야.","source_cn":"是啊，虽然她有那么一点不情愿，但总体而言，她愿意为我付...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE2F46067522C021","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511447006:0":{"text":"설마... 내가 수컷만 유혹할 수 있다고 생각한 거야?","source_cn":"哎呀，你该不会天真地以为，我只能诱惑雄性吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59704328C814B387","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511447007:0":{"text":"당신... 대... 대체 누구야!!","source_cn":"你……你到底是什么人？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3622EA0478AB6CBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511447008:0":{"text":"응? 방금 직접 말하지 않았나? ...악마라고.","source_cn":"嗯？你刚刚不是已经说出口了吗？——是恶魔啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66A0BA5F426DD045","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511447009:0":{"text":"아니면 내 이름이 궁금한 거야?\n내 이름은 <style=\"highlight\">메히라</style>. 모든 이의 마음속에 있는... 욕망의 화신이지.","source_cn":"还是说你想要知道我的名字？\\n我名为<style=hi...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2523C6E57ECD6460","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511447010:0":{"text":"어때, 이름 좀 예쁘지 않아?","source_cn":"怎么样，是不是一个很动听的名字？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0B14E5DCE8D6E51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1511447011:1":{"text":"절대... 가만두지 않겠어! ","source_cn":"你……我要杀了你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2AC959F1B95802E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511447012:0":{"text":"아이고~ 무서워라~ 뭘 그렇게까지 흥분하고 그래~","source_cn":"我理解你看到我的心情，但别激动